The Variance procedures of this Division shall not be used to:

- (a) Allow a structure or use not authorized in the subject zoning district;

- (b) Allow a prohibited use;

- (c) Allow an increase in maximum building height;

- (d) Waive, vary, modify or otherwise override a condition of approval attached to an amendment, special use permit, or other legislative development approval! under this Zoning Ordinance;

- (e) Reduce, waive, or modify in any manner the minimum lot area or lot width required for any lot;

- (f) Allow the reestablishment of any nonconforming use that has been abandoned or lost its nonconforming rights; or

- (g) Allow the expansion or enlargement of any nonconforming use.

